{"unit_id":"AlloyPlane__dsh-eye-upload#card-zh","repo":"AlloyPlane/dsh-eye-upload","commit":"6ff952b1e1233748054a572c0c1ab1fce96bf43b","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-eye-upload 是面向 DSH Web 的图片上传插件，在聊天输入框工具行添加相机按钮。用户选择 PNG、JPEG、WebP 或 GIF 图片后，插件经服务端保存图片，并将返回路径填入草稿，供 image_understand 视觉工具读取。可设置保存目录和单图大小上限，适合从网页对话提交图片供视觉桥接处理。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:36-57","client/client.js:94-103","dsh/index.js:21-35","dsh/index.js:65-71"]}
{"unit_id":"AlloyPlane__dsh-eye-upload#card-en","repo":"AlloyPlane/dsh-eye-upload","commit":"6ff952b1e1233748054a572c0c1ab1fce96bf43b","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-eye-upload adds a camera button to the DSH Web composer. Selecting a PNG, JPEG, WebP, or GIF uploads it to the DSH server for local storage. The client inserts the returned path into the draft for an image_understand vision tool. Users can configure the save directory and image size limit.","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:36-57","client/client.js:94-103","dsh/index.js:21-35","dsh/index.js:65-71"]}
{"unit_id":"AlloyPlane__dsh-eye-upload#feature-1","repo":"AlloyPlane/dsh-eye-upload","commit":"6ff952b1e1233748054a572c0c1ab1fce96bf43b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-eye-upload 的功能「聊天框选图上传」：用户点击输入框工具行的相机按钮，选择 PNG、JPEG、WebP 或 GIF 图片；客户端把文件编码后提交服务端，服务端保存图片并返回路径。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:36-54","dsh/index.js:37-71"]}
{"unit_id":"AlloyPlane__dsh-eye-upload#feature-2","repo":"AlloyPlane/dsh-eye-upload","commit":"6ff952b1e1233748054a572c0c1ab1fce96bf43b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-eye-upload 的功能「将图片路径填入草稿」：图片上传成功后，客户端把 image_understand 提示语和服务端返回的路径追加到现有草稿，用户可继续编辑并发送。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:53-57"]}
{"unit_id":"AlloyPlane__dsh-eye-upload#feature-3","repo":"AlloyPlane/dsh-eye-upload","commit":"6ff952b1e1233748054a572c0c1ab1fce96bf43b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-eye-upload 的功能「配置图片保存位置与大小上限」：插件可通过 targetDir 指定图片根目录，通过 maxBytes 设置上传大小限制；未提供目录时回退到首个工作区或用户目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh/index.js:21-32","dsh/index.js:54-70"]}
